The first 16 examples suggest that maintenance alerts must be suppressed when `users_affected` is low. Two other examples also change the current model’s decision: row 18 changes to 0, and row 22 changes to 1. I will include both cases in the candidate rules and use the query rows to test the uncertain conditions.
